INTERVIEW QUESTION 1
How can GitHub Copilot help in code refactoring and optimization?
=================================================================

Interview Answer:

GitHub Copilot helps in code refactoring and optimization by suggesting
cleaner, more efficient, and more maintainable code.

It can:

• Identify repetitive code

• Remove unnecessary or unused code

• Suggest better coding practices

• Recommend optimized implementations

• Improve code readability and performance

• Generate a more efficient version of existing code

