INTERVIEW QUESTION 2
How can GitHub Copilot help in generating test cases?
=====================================================

Interview Answer:

GitHub Copilot can automatically generate test cases for existing code.

It can:

• Generate unit test cases

• Suggest edge cases

• Generate test methods

• Improve test coverage

• Reduce manual testing effort

• Save development time

However, developers should always review and validate the generated
test cases before using them.

---

